{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Mixed breed","breed_primary":"Large Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"Since I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Visit me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home!\n\nWhat my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nI can go home today!\n\nI can be slow to adjust to new environments. I prefer to take things at my own pace.\n\nI will need daily physical activity to keep me healthy and happy!\n\nMy Boroughbreaker writes: Took a car ride to Highland Park, walked around, relaxed and an overlook, rolled around in grass. We then got some burgers at McDonalds, went to another quiet area. Melo ate half the burger but I think he most enjoyed riding in the car with his head out the window (he was thethered). We did see a small dog off leash. He stayed like I told him and it was clear he wanted to say hi but didn't pull or cry. He really wasn't reactive to people but we still kept a distance. He loved belly rubs. I did not try to hug or touch his face as suggested but he let me pick up his paw to detangle the leash.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=2&searchType=4&animalid=184661","id":"ac079080601e4e9ea62ebe78751330b7","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/7a0bb7a0eac84381a027e583432ed279-1778112474-1782251625-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/37d6d1638c7847b2b8de1d832ecc678e-1778112475-1778112475-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/098c1231540a4b9db407b6fc65c73a4a-1778112475-1778112475-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/1c8f99f2ae8847749ec7e14d137044b6-1778112474-1778112474-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ffbf624f6f4b4ca48eaf7769cd21a12b-1778112474-17781